# Building Scalable Extended Documents with Zolto 10

AuthorHeader(name=author, date="2026-07-26", role="Principal Architect")

versionBadge()

---

## 1. Introduction

Technical documentation and interactive educational tools require flexible layouts, structured components, and declarative interactive widgets.

> [!NOTE]
> Zolto 10.0.0 provides a complete zero-dependency document engine combining Markdown, Math, Diagrams, Charts, Vector Graphics, Spatial Layouts, Components, and Interactive Widgets.

---

## 2. Interactive Self-Check

Test your understanding of Zolto's architecture below:

@quiz "Zolto 10 Architecture Check" {
  @mcq "What is the maximum number of external runtime dependencies required by Zolto?" {
    @correct "Zero external dependencies"
    @choice "3 NPM packages"
    @choice "12 WebAssembly modules"
  }

  @truefalse "Zolto 10 interactive widgets generate accessible HTML with ARIA roles."
